//MCQs

::Spark-Memory-Management::
Which of the following is the correct statement regarding Spark-Driver?{
    ~ It creates logical and physical plan.
    ~ It is responsible for the conversion of application code into tasks. 
    ~ Driver schedules and distributes the task on the worker nodes
    = All of the above.
}

::Spark-Memory-Management::
Which parameters controls the Amount of memory to use for the driver?{
    ~ spark.driver.cores
    ~ spark.executor.cores
    = spark.driver.memory
    ~ spark.executor.memory
}
